WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
All rows are synthetic USD records. SAP ERP was the original engagement source; this independent demonstration performs no client extraction.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Invoice lines reconcile to headers. Receipts aggregate separately at invoice grain, preventing header-line fanout.

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Receipt cash is distinct from invoiced revenue. Margin and discount ratios use aggregate numerators and denominators.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Failed reconciliation, duplicate keys and unsupported currency prevent publication while valid Gold remains available.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
Finance questions are denied to commercial users before fallback. Document ACLs filter the local lexical-vector search before similarity scoring.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
The local router and answers are deterministic. Databricks metric views, learned embeddings and model serving are reference replacements requiring cloud validation.
